[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.2 System overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRP-001-MILUAV
TITLE: System Overview
STATEMENT: The Military Quad Copter RTOS has completed comprehensive testing with all requirements validated and verified for military deployment.
RATIONALE: System overview provides context for test report summary.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.3 Document overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRP-002-MILUAV
TITLE: Document Structure
STATEMENT: This document provides a summary of test results, referenced documents, test results summary, and requirements traceability per MIL-STD-498.
RATIONALE: Structured documentation supports test validation and compliance.

[[/SECTION]]

