[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 3. Test results summary

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRP-003-MILUAV
TITLE: Overall Test Results
STATEMENT: All test phases (unit, integration, system, flight, security) completed with 100% pass rate and 100% requirements coverage.
RATIONALE: Overall test results ensure system readiness for deployment.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRP-004-MILUAV
TITLE: Performance Test Results
STATEMENT: Performance testing validated real-time requirements with flight control loops at 1kHz and sensor fusion at 100Hz as specified.
RATIONALE: Performance test results ensure system meets operational requirements.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRP-005-MILUAV
TITLE: Security Test Results
STATEMENT: Security testing validated FIPS 140-2 Level 3 compliance, encryption, authentication, and threat detection capabilities.
RATIONALE: Security test results ensure protection against military threats.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRP-006-MILUAV
TITLE: Safety Test Results
STATEMENT: Safety testing validated fault tolerance, emergency procedures, and graceful degradation under failure conditions.
RATIONALE: Safety test results ensure system reliability and mission safety.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 4. Requirements traceability

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRP-007-MILUAV
TITLE: Requirements Coverage
STATEMENT: All software requirements were tested and validated with 100% traceability and coverage achieved.
RATIONALE: Requirements coverage ensures complete system validation.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 5. Notes

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRP-008-MILUAV
TITLE: Deployment Readiness
STATEMENT: The Military Quad Copter RTOS is ready for deployment with all test requirements satisfied and military compliance achieved.
RATIONALE: Deployment readiness ensures system can be fielded safely.

[[/SECTION]] 